    {
      "source": "since 4.5, use <a href=\"ValidatingEntityCallback.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping.event\"><code>ValidatingEntityCallback</code></a> respectively <a href=\"ReactiveValidatingEntityCallback.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping.event\"><code>ReactiveValidatingEntityCallback</code></a>\n            instead to ensure ordering and interruption of saving when encountering validation constraint violations.",
      "translation": "自 4.5 版本起，请使用 <a href=\"ValidatingEntityCallback.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping.event\"><code>ValidatingEntityCallback</code></a> 或 <a href=\"ReactiveValidatingEntityCallback.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping.event\"><code>ReactiveValidatingEntityCallback</code></a>，以确保在遇到验证约束违规时能够按顺序保存并中断操作。",
